{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06610","headline":"同诸公登慈恩寺塔 · 储光羲","name":"同诸公登慈恩寺塔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金祠起真宇，直上青云垂。\n地静我亦闲，登之秋清时。\n苍芜宜春苑，片碧昆明池。\n谁道天汉高，逍遥方在兹。\n虚形宾太极，携手行翠微。\n雷雨傍杳冥，鬼神中躨跜。\n灵变在倏忽，莫能穷天涯。\n冠上阊阖开，履下鸿雁飞。\n宫室低逦迤，羣山小参差。\n俯仰宇宙空，庶随了义归。\n崱屴非大厦，久居亦以危。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06610.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06610","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}